# Machine-local dotenv files are gitignored, so CI can never see them. Keeping them out of
# the build context stops one from reaching rsbuild's loadEnv, which merges every key it finds
# into process.env and could re-enable the preloaded-auth seed in a shipped image (issue #158).
# `.env` joined the list when it was untracked (issue #142): the build stages copy the tracked
# `.env.example` to `.env` instead, so the values RSBuild inlines are the same ones the committed
# serve.json CSP was generated from, and a deployment repoints the API through APP_CONFIG_*.
.env
.env*.local

/base

